#: ../doc/titles.rst:382
msgid "Installing Inkscape"
msgstr "Instalando Inkscape"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:384
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Advanced Editor` feature in the :guilabel:`Title Editor` "
"dialog requires the latest version of Inkscape "
"(https://inkscape.org/release/) be installed and the OpenShot "
"**Preferences** updated with the correct path to the Inkscape executable. "
"See the :ref:`preferences_general_ref` tab in Preferences."
msgstr ""
"La función :guilabel:`Editor Avanzado` en el diálogo :guilabel:`Editor de "
"Títulos` requiere que esté instalada la última versión de Inkscape "
"(https://inkscape.org/release/) y que las **Preferencias** de OpenShot estén"
" actualizadas con la ruta correcta al ejecutable de Inkscape. Consulta la "
"pestaña :ref:`preferences_general_ref` en Preferencias."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:391
msgid "Installing Blender"
msgstr "Instalando Blender"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/titles.rst:393
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Animated Title` feature in OpenShot requires the latest "
"version of Blender (https://www.blender.org/download/) be installed and the "
"OpenShot **Preferences** updated with the correct path to the Blender "
"executable. See the :ref:`preferences_general_ref` tab in Preferences. NOTE:"
" The minimum supported version of Blender is 5.0+. Older versions of Blender"
" are not compatible with OpenShot Video Editor."
msgstr ""
"La función :guilabel:`Título Animado` en OpenShot requiere que esté "
"instalada la última versión de Blender (https://www.blender.org/download/) y"
" que las **Preferencias** de OpenShot estén actualizadas con la ruta "
"correcta al ejecutable de Blender. Consulta la pestaña "
":ref:`preferences_general_ref` en Preferencias. NOTA: La versión mínima "
"compatible de Blender es 5.0+. Las versiones anteriores de Blender no son "
"compatibles con OpenShot Video Editor."

